1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,313
Hi everyone! This app is built to help Tamil Nadu students score high in NEET and secure a seat in top Government Medical Colleges like Madras Medical College.

2
00:00:13,353 --> 00:00:29,331
It brings together over 7,480 verified NEET questions, 40 official past papers, and a 24/7 bilingual Gemini AI Coach all in one place. Let's take a look!

3
00:00:29,371 --> 00:00:42,813
First is the Exam & Practice Workspace, where you can take full-length Mock Tests with 180 compulsory questions in 180 minutes — just like the real NEET exam.

4
00:00:42,853 --> 00:00:58,517
Filter across Physics, Chemistry, Botany, and Zoology, track your bubbles live on the OMR sheet on the left, and switch between English and Tamil anytime.

5
00:00:58,557 --> 00:01:10,930
Next is Guided Practice Mode. Worried about losing -1 negative marks on tricky options in NEET? Don't worry at all.

6
00:01:10,970 --> 00:01:24,583
As soon as you pick an option, it shows why the answer is right, exposes the exact -1 negative-mark trap in wrong options, and cites the exact NCERT chapter and page.

7
00:01:24,623 --> 00:01:35,580
What if you get stuck on a question while studying? Just ask the built-in Gemini AI Coach on the right directly in Tamil or English.

8
00:01:35,620 --> 00:01:48,881
Simply tap 'Explain in Tamil', 'Step-by-Step', or '-1 Trap Check' — the AI Coach reads your active question and explains the concept clearly like a personal tutor.

9
00:01:48,921 --> 00:02:02,914
The second tab is the Past Papers & Exemplar Archive, featuring all 40 official NEET and AIPMT question papers from 2000 right up to 2026.

10
00:02:02,954 --> 00:02:14,731
It also includes official Tamil medium booklets and a dedicated module for Supreme Court landmark rulings and bonus-mark questions.

11
00:02:14,771 --> 00:02:23,605
To score 340+ out of 360 in NEET Biology, mastering every single line of the NCERT textbook is essential.

12
00:02:23,645 --> 00:02:36,188
That's why we included over 700 NCERT Exemplar questions, 340+ NCERT Line-by-Line Biology questions with exact quotes, and full NTA Abhyas mock tests.

13
00:02:36,228 --> 00:02:48,522
The third tab is the Score & Mentor Tracker, which records your score, accuracy, and projected mark out of 720 across every test you take.

14
00:02:48,562 --> 00:03:08,246
It predicts your eligible medical college under Tamil Nadu's 85% State Quota and 7.5% Government School Quota, lets you re-test your mistakes, and shares progress on WhatsApp.

15
00:03:08,286 --> 00:03:18,358
The fourth tab is the Tamil Nadu NEET Guide & YouTube Hub, featuring the proven 3-Round OMR Time-Management strategy used by 720/720 toppers.

16
00:03:18,398 --> 00:03:35,432
Plus, get direct links to top Tamil and English NEET YouTube channels like Biology Simplified Tamil and Muruga MP. Practice daily with confidence — All the Best!
